      11: "The energy of a clear mind, a reviving family, diligence, gentleness and steadiness, and of wealth, honor and authority. Many people like and follow this person. Good with people, and warm-hearted. People gather around, and that means wealth gathering and property increasing. The occupations are the press, publishing, medicine and the military.",
      12: "Things seem to go well and then end in failure at the last moment. Matters that must be brought to a close — study, business, a marriage proposal — tend to leave regret.",
