      14: "There is the strength to live so hard and fiercely that, even in a crisis, people call this person relentless. When it acts as misfortune, what goes well tends to end badly, and one meets the energy of scattering and ruin — separation and divorce, accidents and prison, illness and surgery.                                    When it falls in the early years, it is called \"wisdom and talent,\" family fortune is not good, and if the birth chart is bad one may be seriously ill while young.               When it falls in the overall destiny, it is called \"scattering and loneliness\": the bond between husband and wife is thin and home fortune is poor, so marriage comes late, or even an early marriage brings many partings. With age, one must be careful of illness, surgery, failure, frustration, divorce, incurable disease, cancer and suicide.",
