      16: "So kind-hearted that it is hard to refuse others' requests; thin-eared, easily swayed, and quick to stand as guarantor, so this person tends to shoulder that responsibility. Like a scholar of old, a thoroughly upright person, and when a good hexagram is met it is also a great money fortune.",
