      18: "The energy of wisdom, conviction, will, great achievement and artistry. With outstanding wisdom and firm conviction, the spirit of one who can achieve great deeds. Richly talented in medicine, technology, the arts and public service, and rises to a respected position. Often seen in medicine, technology, the arts, entertainment and the civil service.",
      19: "The energy of temporary success, a clear mind, loneliness, illness, early death, a turbulent life, and suffering from illness. The number of being betrayed by the axe one trusted, and of those one helped turning into enemies. The mind is clear and success comes for a time, but it does not last — betrayal and loneliness always follow.                                             When it comes in the early years, it is called \"wise loneliness,\" and one is able at work done alone, so there is a strong tendency to spend time alone — reading, writing poetry, painting, sculpting, studying abroad, or living in a dormitory.                                 When it falls in the overall destiny, it is called \"phoenix loneliness\": suited to the work of an educator or a business person, and even if the birth chart is not good at all, one lives a whole life without worrying about money or a house.",
