      22: "With outstanding wisdom and good looks, this person surges ahead for a time, but inevitably meets frustration midway — the fortune of the opposition. Business, study and marriage are easily abandoned halfway, and failure from missing the right moment is common. Living fiercely, with age one may also suffer adult illnesses such as high blood pressure, diabetes and cancer. It is the pattern of leaves falling in the autumn wind. Many are good-looking and large in capacity, but they also speak ill of others.",
