      24: "The energy of wealth and honor together, and of sincere effort. Abundant property, but empty-handed: at first there is nothing, yet through steady effort this person gathers wealth. A supremely auspicious fortune of succeeding and spreading one's name widely. There is also the energy of pursuing power, and luck with women.                                                                        When it falls in the overall destiny, it is called \"sincere authority,\" and this person shows a high interest in power and rushes about to secure it.",
      25: "The energy of self-made success, great achievements, outstanding wisdom, politics and law. With outstanding wisdom, wit, frankness and a distinct personality, this person makes their own way and achieves great things. They enjoy wealth and glory as a figure in finance, politics, law or business.",
      26: "A turbulent fortune, like a hero, a fighter or a patriot. Study and daily life are hard to keep steady, trials are many, and even if outstanding wisdom and courage spread one's name, overconfidence brings only sacrifice and this person is easily cast out. It is the turbulent fortune of a great politician, a patriot or a martyr, but after giving everything away and going hungry, one is ostracized by the crowd, parts from a spouse or is bereaved, is childless, and in a strange place suffers illness as a disabled person, a murder victim or an unnatural death.",
