      29: "The energy of extraordinary talent, abundant wisdom, and skill in dealing with the world. Talent is outstanding and wisdom is abundant. With wit, skilled at getting along, and especially a supremely auspicious fortune that can seize both property and power at once, but impatience for success can also bring a block or a slump.",
