      40: "Even a time of success comes to nothing — success through speculation, but success and failure are many. Outstanding wisdom and nerve can bring great success in speculative business and the like, but success and failure change without end, so even a time of success comes to nothing, and one lives lonely, tasting emptiness amid blame.",
