      44: "Vain thoughts and dreams invite the devil's hand and obstacles, and there are cases of ruining oneself by fraud or embezzlement. A number of fighting a hundred times and losing a hundred times. But if, on top of outstanding talent, one keeps to one's station, there is no great trouble, and step by step one succeeds, gains people's trust as a great scholar, a religious figure or a great inventor, attains wealth and fame, and it can also become a lucky fortune of long life.",
