      48: "There is virtue, and while upright, an ordinary character becomes a model for everyone. Rather than starting one's own business, acting as an advisor or counselor who leads others does not lose good fortune. Wealth is left to descendants, social trust is deep, happy events always reach the house, and husband and wife get along, so everything is accomplished in comfort and smoothness.",
