      64: "The pattern of a flower bud meeting cold frost. Vitality declines, so even a good plan all fails, ruin of family and self and disaster never cease, and it is a number of unlucky fortune such as illness and early death. One pushes work forward on desire alone, so a start exists but the finish is hard, and reckless decisiveness spoils a great matter, so one lives a life of severe ups and downs.",
