      66: "The pattern of a traveler losing the lamp on a dark night. Advance and retreat are both blocked, the future is dark, disaster pours out, and home unrest, ruin of family and self, frailty and hardship follow. There is no planning in anything, so mistakes arise and nothing is finished to the end. Every task meets an obstacle and nothing proceeds properly.",
