      69: "The start looks plausible, but fortune gradually declines, everything is unsafe, and upheaval breaks out. Family members live scattered, husband and wife do not blend, the family does not harmonize, so one becomes lonely, and it is a number that draws the worst of bad fortune — frailty, hardship, suicide and early death. The mind is always anxious and worry never stops, so the will is weak and indecisive, and one loses the ability to handle work properly. An unlucky pattern.",
      70: "A gloomy character, confidence is lacking in everything, and worries keep arising around one. Even spouse fortune meets a bad bond, and the two think of each other as enemies, a number that draws a miserable fortune of punishment, disability, a violent death and early death. Nothing one plans proceeds properly, and looking in every direction there is only loneliness, and the sighs never stop.",
