      73: "Follow-through and patience are lacking, so a great work is achieved, but one is enjoying nature's welfare, and so life is uneventful and ordinarily lucky, a number of peace in the family. Even if wisdom, courage and decisiveness are lacking, one pursues the ordinary and lives satisfied in a small happiness, so life is uneventful and smooth.",
      74: "Talent is abundant in many fields, but rises and falls and unrest are many, so talent dies out and failure in work is common. Unexpected disaster and accident raise a fortune in which a great aim cannot even be tried, and one spends a whole life idle. It draws upheaval, accident, sudden disaster, distress and disability.",
      75: "The inborn mind is gentle and virtuous, intellectual, and equipped with cool thinking, so one is skillful in everything, greatly succeeds on one's own, and wins everyone's trust. A lucky fortune. More passive than active, but one knows how to keep the substance and does not lose a careful attitude. A socially stable base can be made, and with an affectionate married love one can grow old together.",
      76: "A number with no inheritance from the ancestors, and with no virtue from close family.",
      77: "A thoughtful character with outstanding careful calculation and judgment. A steady working attitude is recognized, and a benefactor's help never stops in everything one manages, so a crisis is wisely overcome and great success is achieved.",
      78: "There is wit and the character is fine, so many people follow, but there is no benefactor who can help. Follow-through is lacking, so reaching the aim is not easy.",
