      80: "What one achieves with effort rarely bears good fruit. Hardship never stops throughout life, thinking is narrow and stubbornness is strong, so it is hard to get along with others, and fortune itself is the shape of dark clouds over the bright sun, so what one intends is not properly accomplished.",
      81: "The most auspicious and supreme number, as heaven opens. After the creation of heaven and earth, the elements return to one — the number of light. The number of the origin of all things, with the greatest life force of nature. The fortune of great success."
